  "adaptations": [
    "Original source controls use existing cloud command and revision receipts. One frozen command survives ambiguous failure; definite validation failures release it; stale revisions require read-only reload.",
    "Account timezone is explicit for history, scheduled timestamps, date controls and Dashboard previews. Original goal/time/recurrence helpers are copied from canonical owners; no schema or formula changes.",
    "Installed Temporal 0.5.1 and JSBI ESM assets retain licenses; bare import and source-map comments are rewritten for browser delivery.",
    "Production CSP uses SVG/CSS icons and CSSOM popover placement without inline style attributes. Shared source fasting layout remains in public/shell-source/discover.css.",
    "More and Discover supply their own Back destination. Dashboard New Fast opens quick start; settings New Fast opens the schedule editor directly."
  ],
  "verification": [
    "Production-CSP Chrome flow through mountNutrition and mountMore, 412px dark and 320px light; account Chicago/browser Tokyo.",
    "Schedule duration/end wheel synchronization; recurrence presets/custom limits/cancel/back; schedule creation/start-now/deletion.",
    "Completed history duration retains goal; repeat retains schedule independence; delete cancellation preserves draft; canonical stats and 102-row pagination/100-row selection bound.",
    "Lost-response exact receipt retry; 400 validation unlock; 409 reload; successful-write/read-failure retry; disposal prevents late UI mount."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Hosted verification is performed by the parent release task. Physical phone touch momentum and native display were not tested in this increment."
  ]
